# Third-party component carried in this repository

## ephemora-cell 2.2.0 — Apache License 2.0

The WASM sandbox that executes a delivery and signs the execution report. Copyright Michael Soppa.
Redistributed here as an unmodified wheel so a judge can run the receipt path without network access
to a package index (the project is not published on PyPI).

- `ephemora_cell-2.2.0-py3-none-any.whl` — built from the Apache-2.0 source, no changes
- `LICENSE.ephemora-cell` — the licence text as shipped with the source
- `README.ephemora-cell.md` — the project's own readme

Install together with its one runtime dependency:

    pip install wasmtime vendor/ephemora_cell-2.2.0-py3-none-any.whl
